1
00:00:00,458 --> 00:00:01,458
Ji-sung.

2
00:00:01,543 --> 00:00:02,961
Yeah?

3
00:00:04,963 --> 00:00:07,465
Can I talk more casually
with you?

4
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:10,010
Of course.

5
00:00:10,844 --> 00:00:11,761
Ji-sung

6
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:15,181
rehab was just your excuse
to get close to me, right?

7
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:18,184
No way.

8
00:00:18,184 --> 00:00:20,020
That's not...

9
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:27,569
Speaking of rehab

10
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:30,488
Jeong-min said he wants to
help with my training.

11
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:31,990
Jeong-min?

12
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:35,827
He said I reminded him of
himself when he was injured.

13
00:00:35,827 --> 00:00:36,911
Oh.

14
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:41,501
Seems like he's going to

15
00:00:41,502 --> 00:00:42,702
keep showing up
because of you.

16
00:00:43,805 --> 00:00:46,474
So what do you think
about me training with him?

17
00:00:47,076 --> 00:00:48,160
You?

18
00:00:48,339 --> 00:00:50,008
Yeah.

19
00:00:50,008 --> 00:00:53,678
I mean, training with a pro's
a big opportunity, right?

20
00:00:54,846 --> 00:00:56,681
Why? Is that a problem?

21
00:01:00,435 --> 00:01:01,936
No.

22
00:01:02,312 --> 00:01:06,191
Why? Something going on
between you two?

23
00:01:06,733 --> 00:01:08,359
Nothing.

24
00:01:09,527 --> 00:01:14,407
I'm just... worried about
losing time training with you.

25
00:01:16,638 --> 00:01:19,641
Then I'll only train with you.

26
00:01:31,216 --> 00:01:32,383
You little punk.

27
00:01:39,884 --> 00:01:40,884
[Logging into Kick-In...]

28
00:01:40,885 --> 00:01:42,405
[Share everything
futsal has to offer.]
